{"artifact_kind":"issue_comment","external_id":"issue_comment-4849820001","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T18:35:09.814290+00:00","raw":{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"\nThe React compiler relies on assumptions about dependencies and pure functions to provide memoization; when the assumptions are not met, the compiler will bail out. React is compiled to \"just JS\" at the end of the day, and JS allows you to do a lot of dynamic stuff that can be sub-optimal. \n\nThe React Compiler doesn't memoize this hook because it violates the Rules of React in ways that make automatic memoization unsafe or impossible. You can see a full explanation from an [LLM](https://t3.chat/share/yl29n7n0xq)\n\n\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T02:49:18Z","html_url":"https://github.com/react/react/issues/36847#issuecomment-4849820001","id":4849820001,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/36847","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks8AAAABIRJhYQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4849820001/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-01T02:49:18Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4849820001","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12485737?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MaxwellCohen","id":12485737,"login":"MaxwellCohen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDg1NzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MaxwellCohen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.